[[compiler-serialization]]
=== Serialization

**STUB**: Specifies how generated code serializes values at language
boundaries. Covers how packers and unpackers come from `Packable` instances and
how they are paired across languages. Covers how functions are passed between
languages through defunctionalization, and how recursive data types are
serialized. Defines the wire form a type must have so that every language
agrees on it.

